"source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトと馴染めないハーフの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見が完全に外人＝金髪碧眼のため周囲から浮いてしまうが、実は根っからの日本人（海外に出たこともない）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は和菓子派。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"律儀で生真面目な性格で、買い食いは校則違反だから、と結局お店で買い物をしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おばあちゃんっ子で語彙が古めかしい。なつ子とはハブとマングースの仲。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6351","sourceWorkId":"21638","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は外国人、心はジャパニーズ。 クラスで浮いてしまっているハーフの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"金髪碧眼だが海外に出たことはなく、おばあちゃんっ子で語彙が古めかしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は律儀で生真面目。 和菓子派。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"買い食いは校則違反だからと、主人公のお店で買い物をしてくれない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おちゃらけた性格のなつ子とは、ハブとマングースの仲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ベ…べりーサンキュー」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44065"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/04a0e6d9293e3ca468d95dea224a5925b98afe1d3488c2fdec11209b7cf50738.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/dad58732f5ec3ba1e2c728c5ba63d898a1ec49efe8a70de8e3ef86a544dc7993.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春岡沙和","creatorId":"vndb:s5545","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5545","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5545","name":"春岡 沙和","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126076:44065:19318:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34488","characterName":"芦沢 椎","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44066","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126076"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6352"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34488"},"originalCharacterName":"芦沢 椎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptio