子を観察したい」という己の欲求を満たすことが目的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ときにヒロインたちの相談役になり、ときに主人公の背中を押す、基本的には面倒見のいい女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし変態。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6354","sourceWorkId":"21638","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・春樹の妹。 お店を意欲的に手伝ってくれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただそれは兄のためではなく、“かわいい女の子を観察したい” という己の欲求を満たすため。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時にヒロインたちの相談役になり、時に春樹の背中を押す、基本的には面倒見のいい女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし変態。 将来の夢は “エロゲの主人公”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「んはあっ、かわいい女の子からの罵声なら大歓迎！　いいよ、もっとなじって！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44068"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2edd678f057cdd388f177d9662c002aa97279ff5fdf3eebfaf15c25fbc9dacef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/9070791d40fef3d76f47cc3b190aa6c67b8b6c3ef36b1a0a4e92406f42945c73.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"米島希","creatorId":"vndb:s281","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s281","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s281","name":"米島 希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126076:44068:8055:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34491","characterName":"萌木 香織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44069","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126076"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6355"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34491"},"originalCharacterName":"萌木 香織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"母子家庭で芽瑠を育てている、明るくてバイタリティに溢れたお母さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自立心の強い女性で、仕事も家事も育児も一人でやりきっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在宅勤務のＷＥＢデザイナー。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6355","sourceWorkId":"21638","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"芽瑠の母親。 母子家庭で芽瑠を育てている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自立心の強いバイタリティーあふれる女性で、仕事も家事も育児も一人でやりきっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若いのに頼もしく、そして明るい友達みたいなお母さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事は在宅勤務の WEBデザイナー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ダイジョーブだって！　店長さんなら信頼出来るからさ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44069"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c0ec377e5e0b966baff881806094b69c31fa7189274d3353992fa5174f0e9fd5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ad64b6ab71e1f252a365e79798a88a2f639f2db2ec9de93ab61af06b99f49ee3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126076:44069:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34492","characterName":"佐久間 春樹","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["6348"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34492"},"originalCharacterName":"佐久間 春樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お菓子屋さん「ロリポップ・ファクトリー」店主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大学卒業後より祖母から譲り受けた店を切り盛りする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異性に対して常に紳士的で、レディファースト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この態度は決して年齢に左右されない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、恋愛対象が極端なまでの年下になっても躊躇しない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当人は自分を常識人だと思っている様子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6348","sourceWorkId":"21638","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p3290","sourc